  AttackPriority | doc "A master's attack priority (`+0x92c`, `FUN_141202220`; the `.dat`'s combat part): a number\nthe unit AIs' attack checks read by value. Priority 3 limits most of them to the classes of\n`PRIORITY_3_CLASSES`; 1 and 2 let the lion and the predators choose anything; 0 holds the\nrams and the trebuchets to their own targets and 1 ranks the best target." = std.contract.from_predicate (fun x => std.is_number x && x % 1 == 0 && 0 <= x && x <= 255),
