    touch | Number | doc "The squared reach of an attack without a range (`DAT_142ed48e4`): `0x3c23d70b`, which is `0.1f * 0.1f`, one ULP above `0.01f`.\n\n`attack::TOUCH`: 0.010000001 in build 158041.",
