    flags | SpriteFlags | doc "`+0x1a`, `sequence_type`.",
  },
  Graphics | doc "What the sprite clock reads of each graphic (the `.dat`'s), by sprite id: a dense column\nby the id (the `.dat`'s ids are 0 and up), walked in the ids' order. Two tables are equal\nwhen they hold the same sprites and graphics, as two maps are." = {
