    default_radius | Number | doc "A unit's radius in a formation where its master has no full footprint (`FUN_141025920`, `DAT_142e7f384`).\n\n`group::DEFAULT_RADIUS`: 0.5 in build 158041.",
    far | Number | doc "A member farther than this from its slot leaves the group (`FUN_14100bcb0`'s far test, `DAT_142e7f38c`).\n\n`group::FAR`: 20 in build 158041.",
    far_wide | Number | doc "The far test's distance in a formation of type 7, or once a member of radius `GroupTuning::wide_radius` or more came before (`DAT_142ecbff0`).\n\n`group::FAR_WIDE`: 40 in build 158041.",
    flank_spacing | Number | doc "A flanked line's slots move apart by this less the line's share of the depth (`DAT_142eb3634`).\n\n`group::FLANK_SPACING`: 2.5 in build 158041.",
    front_share | Number | doc "The share of the lead's line of sight a follow keeps within (`DAT_142e7f384`).\n\n`group::FRONT_SHARE`: 0.5 in build 158041.",
    horde_reach | Number | doc "A horde's and a user defined formation's slots lie at most this far from the group's place (`DAT_14330ebb8`).\n\n`group::HORDE_REACH`: 5 in build 158041.",
    linked_radius | Number | doc "A moving object whose top speed is 0 and whose radius on either axis is above this links its tiles at a new place (`FUN_14108c320`, `DAT_142e7f384`).\n\n`group::LINKED_RADIUS`: 0.5 in build 158041.",
    map_edge | Number | doc "A slot's place kept this far inside the map's far edges (`FUN_14100b760`, `DAT_142eb5690`).\n\n`group::MAP_EDGE`: 0.1 in build 158041.",
    member_min_hp | Number | doc "A group's member below these hit points takes no task (`DAT_14330eb8c`).\n\n`group::MEMBER_MIN_HP`: 1 in build 158041.",
    near | Number | doc "How near a point the walk counts as there (`DAT_142eb5690`).\n\n`group::NEAR`: 0.1 in build 158041.",
    pass_far | Number | doc "The passability's box starts at this (`DAT_142eea788`) on its low sides, 0 on its high ones.\n\n`group::PASS_FAR`: 10000 in build 158041.",
    pass_half_margin | Number | doc "The grid starts this far below the box (`DAT_142ed6f20`).\n\n`group::PASS_HALF_MARGIN`: 25 in build 158041.",
    pass_margin | Number | doc "The passability's grid holds the box plus this (`DAT_142eb0f50`) and one more cell a side.\n\n`group::PASS_MARGIN`: 50 in build 158041.",
    pass_share | Number | doc "Below this share of the slots' array reachable (`DAT_142eae8d0`), only the nearest slot is.\n\n`group::PASS_SHARE`: 0.2 in build 158041.",
    patrol_leg_reach | Number | doc "A patrol's leg goes back and forth when its point is at least this far from the group on the ground (`commandMoveTo` at 0x141010ddb, `DAT_14330ebb8`).\n\n`group::PATROL_LEG_REACH`: 5 in build 158041.",
    pull_distance | Number | doc "The members' centre pulls the group when it is this far (squared, `DAT_142eb0f48`) ...\n\n`group::PULL_DISTANCE`: 4 in build 158041.",
    pull_keep | Number | doc "The share of its own place the group keeps when the members' centre pulls it (`DAT_142ecb878`).\n\n`group::PULL_KEEP`: 0.8 in build 158041.",
    pull_share | Number | doc "The members' centre's share of the group's new place when it pulls the group (`DAT_142eae8d0`).\n\n`group::PULL_SHARE`: 0.2 in build 158041.",
    ranged_slack | Number | doc "What a group's attack adds to the range against a target in range, and to a moving target's weapon range for the outrange test (`DAT_142e8c150`).\n\n`group::RANGED_SLACK`: 2 in build 158041.",
    short_length | Number | doc "A path shorter than this is no path (`DAT_142eb99cc`).\n\n`group::SHORT_LENGTH`: 0.01 in build 158041.",
    short_reach | Number | doc "The short pather serves a waypoint this near (`DAT_142eb0f4c`).\n\n`group::SHORT_REACH`: 10 in build 158041.",
    slot_nudge_x | Array (Number) | doc "The x nudges of a slot the passability grid moves where its spacing is below a cell, by its parity (`DAT_142f49470`).\n\n`group::SLOT_NUDGE_X`: [0, 0.25, -0.25, 0] in build 158041.",
    slot_nudge_z | Array (Number) | doc "The z nudges of a slot the passability grid moves where its spacing is below a cell, by its parity (`DAT_142f49dd0`).\n\n`group::SLOT_NUDGE_Z`: [0, 0, 0, 0.25] in build 158041.",
    slot_reach | Number | doc "A member within this many radii of its slot, or this far, walks at its top speed (`DAT_14330ebb8`, loaded once at `0x1410279d1` for both).\n\n`group::SLOT_REACH`: 5 in build 158041.",
    slow_group_factor | Number | doc "A group with `GroupFlags::CATCHING_UP` moves at its slowest member's speed divided by this (`FUN_14100bcb0`, `DAT_142ed66b4`).\n\n`group::SLOW_GROUP_FACTOR`: 1.2 in build 158041.",
    spacing_factor | Number | doc "A staggered line's offset is twice the spacing, and an even line moves by half the offset (`DAT_142e8c150`).\n\n`group::SPACING_FACTOR`: 2 in build 158041.",
    square_max | Number | doc "... or above this (`DAT_14330eb78`).\n\n`group::SQUARE_MAX`: 0.05 in build 158041.",
    square_min | Number | doc "`FUN_141049e10` refuses a forward whose dot product with the up is below this (`DAT_142f4c1a0`) ...\n\n`group::SQUARE_MIN`: -0.05 in build 158041.",
    stagger_share | Number | doc "A staggered line moves by a quarter of the slot offset (`DAT_142eb0f48`).\n\n`group::STAGGER_SHARE`: 4 in build 158041.",
