    death_blast_hp | Number | doc "The hit points below which they blast (`DAT_14330eb8c`; `COMISS`, a NaN does not).\n\n`turn::DEATH_BLAST_HP`: 1 in build 158041.",
    drop_reach | Number | doc "The range the short path measures a drop site within (`DAT_142eb5690`).\n\n`turn::DROP_REACH`: 0.1 in build 158041.",
    eject_share | Number | doc "A building at most this share of its hit points lets its garrison out (`DAT_142eae8d0`).\n\n`turn::EJECT_SHARE`: 0.2 in build 158041.",
    farm_stages | Number | doc "The stages over the build time (`DAT_142eb1c98`).\n\n`turn::FARM_STAGES`: 3 in build 158041.",
    fishing_reach | Number | doc "The squared footprint gap within which a fishing ship counts a drop site its path does not reach (`DAT_14330ebcc`).\n\n`turn::FISHING_REACH`: 100 in build 158041.",
    gate_grow | Number | doc "A gate's query grows its records and its own box by this (`FUN_1410562d0` with `DAT_142eb3630`).\n\n`turn::GATE_GROW`: 0.4 in build 158041.",
    gate_shut_height | Number | doc "The least height of a shut gate its player opens (`FUN_14162f7e0`, `DAT_14330eb8c`).\n\n`turn::GATE_SHUT_HEIGHT`: 1 in build 158041.",
    hero_regeneration | Number | doc "A hero's regeneration (`DAT_142ed06a8`, a minute's hit points).\n\n`turn::HERO_REGENERATION`: 30 in build 158041.",
    hp_powerup_floor | Number | doc "The hit points a powerup's check leaves at least (`MAXSS` with `DAT_14330eb8c`).\n\n`turn::HP_POWERUP_FLOOR`: 1 in build 158041.",
    regeneration_least_hp | Number | doc "The hit points below which nothing regenerates (`DAT_14330eb8c`).\n\n`turn::REGENERATION_LEAST_HP`: 1 in build 158041.",
    regeneration_point | Number | doc "A whole hit point, the `fmodf` divisor (`XMM11`, `DAT_14330eb8c`).\n\n`turn::REGENERATION_POINT`: 1 in build 158041.",
