    treason_cost | Number | doc "What Treason's command takes off the pending debit of gold (`DAT_142eb5bd4`, 400.0, read at `0x140e7c73d`).\n\n`turn::TREASON_COST`: 400 in build 158041.",
    tree_search_within | Number | doc "`FUN_140ac4670`'s first argument when a hunt's target went on the walk to it, or its `MoveTo` failed (`DAT_142eb9430`): the hunt searches within this of its point.\n\n`turn::TREE_SEARCH_WITHIN`: 8 in build 158041.",
  },
