    evade_edge | Number | doc "`evasiveMoveTo` (`FUN_140c4d140`): a coordinate at or past the map's size goes this far in (`DAT_14330eb8c`).\n\n`unit_ai::EVADE_EDGE`: 1 in build 158041.",
