    follow_slack_low | Number | doc "The follow order's target counts as moved when its offset from the AI's target point on either axis is below this (`0x140c567c0`, `DAT_14330ec20`).\n\n`unit_ai::FOLLOW_SLACK_LOW`: -1 in build 158041.",
